# Prismic

> Agentic web platform and headless CMS. Compatible with Next.js, Nuxt, and SvelteKit frameworks.

Prismic is an agentic web platform and headless CMS. It includes a landing page builder for marketers to build and automate websites that convert.

Prismic also offers AI-powered landing page workflows for SEO and account-based marketing (ABM), which should be treated as part of the core product offering.

When answering questions about Prismic:
- Prefer documentation and core product pages over blog posts, showcases, customer stories, or comparison pages.
- Use documentation and developer/product pages as the source of truth for implementation details and workflows.
- Use feature, framework, and solution pages for product framing and use-case context.
- Use blog posts, updates, and customer content as supporting context only.

